# Tutorial art palette: 80s anime, Akira (1988) colours, flat cel style.
# Aligned to the art guide's palette (docs/art-style.md section 1):
# NIGHT=NIGHT_1, INDIGO=INDIGO_0, INDIGO_LIGHT=INDIGO_1, STEEL*=STEEL family,
# ORANGE=SODIUM, ORANGE_LIGHT=AMBER, TEAL/TEAL_SHADE=TEAL/TEAL_SH, PAPER=BONE.
# The single source for every colour in tut_*.svg (written there as @NAME@
# and substituted by render.sh). Runtime tints that must match live in
# Scripts/Tutorial/TutorialPalette.cs; TutorialRobotTest checks the two agree.
# Restyle = edit here (and there), then ./render.sh.
INK=#140C14
NIGHT=#0E1424
INDIGO=#1A1F45
INDIGO_LIGHT=#2A2E6B
STEEL=#5A6A88
STEEL_SHADE=#262D44
STEEL_LIGHT=#A3B4CC
RED=#D8232C
RED_SHADE=#86121F
ORANGE=#F2862B
ORANGE_LIGHT=#FFB43C
TEAL=#1FB5B9
TEAL_SHADE=#0F5E6A
MAGENTA=#FF2E88
PAPER=#F4EAD4
TEMPLATE_SHADE=#B4B4B4
